{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/015ad751a57465c1f69d073db957aba2.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy the odds in this harsh and brutal environment. Scavenge resources, cook food, craft goods and prepare medicines to ensure you, and your growing community thrives. In a world of famine and hardship, of disease and death, become a hero, keeping your villagers happy and healthy, whatever the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/a8d85df94cd4ca6773cd8570dd9eb2ab.poster.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/a8d85df94cd4ca6773cd8570dd9eb2ab.webm?t=1770644306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/c4fe175db68614c62d141b0b4a2ae84a.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raze the forests. Clear cut the timber. Process the materials. Every resource matters. And every resource can be depleted. Manage your environments wisely, don\u2019t use today, what you may need tomorrow. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place the layout of buildings, furniture and workbenches. Designing a village has never been more customizable. You choose where, and what to build. For the first time, you decide who occupies which dwelling. Assign your villagers tasks and housing in a fully responsive world as you seek to maximize your yields.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/7773604f9d3057d6b98e517a6bbe3ffa.poster.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/7773604f9d3057d6b98e517a6bbe3ffa.webm?t=1770644306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/d042d329cce3f9da819ff960f35e502c.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for lost and scattered souls in the wild, bring them into your settlement, and help them build a new life. Each person you rescue has their own traits, needs, and personality. Grow your village in your redemption quest from exile to exalted hero.\u00a0<br>Danger awaits in the many different landscapes. From the ravages of the moor, to the terrors of the forest. With everything wanting only to survive, navigate the world with caution. Brave the hardships. The higher the risk, the higher the reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/0bdbab2481c925130840fee6aa73e2c0.poster.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/0bdbab2481c925130840fee6aa73e2c0.webm?t=1770644306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/d2a5b56ea88b1d701a309342c4ff1e5c.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow the seeds, till the fields and reap the fruits of your labor. Prepare for the winter by stocking up on supplies. You have to prepare nutritious meals and craft healing medicines to keep famine and sickness at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/529d4c555afd2c5284d468481109ce07.poster.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/529d4c555afd2c5284d468481109ce07.webm?t=1770644306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1207360?t=1770644306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/dc6054d6d9e2c4533c8148bf0aee54cfff1963b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770644306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/44ec5b95220600b03c87bdaa3d3066c13fabc076/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770644306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/44ec5b95220600b03c87bdaa3d3066c13fabc076/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770644306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/015ad751a57465c1f69d073db957aba2.avif?t=1770644306\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy the odds in this harsh and brutal